<title>SINGAPORE: Zagro Asia sells property.</title>
<headline>Zagro Asia sells property.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zagro Asia Ltd said on Tuesday it has sold a property for Singapore $2.7 million, a deal that will net an extraordinary gain of about S$2.13 million.</p>
<p>Zagro, which makes and trades animal feed, said in a statement the net proceeds would be used as working capital and to finance future acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
